---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Support Our Work | Compassion Bridge Initiative Uganda">

<Header />

<section class="hero">

<div class="container">

<h1>Support Our Work</h1>

<p>

Together we can restore dignity, build brighter futures, and transform
lives through education, empowerment, compassion and sustainable
community development.

</p>

</div>

</section>

<section class="intro">

<div class="container">

<h2>Every Act of Support Makes a Difference</h2>

<p>

Compassion Bridge Initiative Uganda believes lasting change happens when
communities, partners and individuals work together. Whether you choose
to donate, volunteer, partner with us or sponsor a project, your support
helps vulnerable children, widows, youth and families build better
futures.

</p>

</div>

</section>

<section class="support-grid">

<div class="container">

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">

<h3>🎓 Sponsor a Child</h3>

<p>

Help a vulnerable child remain in school by supporting tuition,
scholastic materials, uniforms and other educational needs.

</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h3>🤝 Become a Partner</h3>

<p>

Partner with us as an NGO, company, church, school, foundation or
individual supporter to create lasting impact.

</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h3>💙 Make a Donation</h3>

<p>

Your financial support helps us expand our education, livelihoods,
health promotion, disability inclusion and community development
programmes.

</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h3>🌱 Support Widows</h3>

<p>

Help widows establish sustainable livelihoods through agriculture,
vocational skills and income-generating activities.

</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h3>🙋 Volunteer With Us</h3>

<p>

Share your time, knowledge and professional skills to strengthen our
programmes and communities.

</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h3>📦 Donate Equipment</h3>

<p>

Support our work by donating computers, books, sewing machines,
educational materials, agricultural tools or other useful equipment.

</p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section class="why-support">

<div class="container">

<h2>Why Support Compassion Bridge Initiative Uganda?</h2>

<div class="reasons">

<div>

<h3>Transparency</h3>

<p>

We are committed to accountability, good governance and responsible
management of every resource entrusted to us.

</p>

</div>

<div>

<h3>Community-Led Solutions</h3>

<p>

Our programmes are designed together with the communities we serve to
ensure sustainable and meaningful impact.

</p>

</div>

<div>

<h3>Long-Term Impact</h3>

<p>

We focus on building resilience through education, livelihoods,
vocational skills and community empowerment rather than temporary
solutions.

</p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>

<section class="cta">

<div class="container">

<h2>Join Us in Restoring Dignity and Building Futures</h2>

<p>

Every contribution—whether financial, practical or voluntary—helps
change lives and strengthen communities.

</p>

<a href="/#contact" class="button">

Contact Us Today

</a>

</div>

</section>

<Footer />

</Layout>

<style>

.hero{

background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0b4f8a,#0b7d65);

color:white;

padding:140px 20px 90px;

text-align:center;

}

.container{

max-width:1150px;

margin:auto;

padding:0 20px;

}

.hero h1{

font-size:54px;

margin-bottom:25px;

}

.hero p{

font-size:22px;

line-height:1.8;

max-width:850px;

margin:auto;

}

.intro{

padding:90px 0;

text-align:center;

}

.intro h2{

font-size:38px;

color:#0b4f8a;

margin-bottom:25px;

}

.intro p{

font-size:19px;

line-height:1.9;

color:#555;

max-width:900px;

margin:auto;

}

.support-grid{

background:#f5f7fb;

padding:90px 0;

}

.grid{

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));

gap:30px;

}

.card{

background:white;

padding:35px;

border-radius:15px;

box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.08);

transition:.3s;

}

.card:hover{

transform:translateY(-8px);

}

.card h3{

color:#0b4f8a;

margin-bottom:18px;

}

.card p{

line-height:1.8;

color:#555;

}

.why-support{

padding:90px 0;

}

.why-support h2{

text-align:center;

font-size:40px;

color:#0b4f8a;

margin-bottom:50px;

}

.reasons{

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));

gap:30px;

}

.reasons div{

background:#f8f8f8;

padding:30px;

border-radius:12px;

}

.reasons h3{

margin-bottom:15px;

color:#0b4f8a;

}

.reasons p{

line-height:1.8;

color:#555;

}

.cta{

background:#0b4f8a;

color:white;

text-align:center;

padding:90px 20px;

}

.cta h2{

font-size:42px;

margin-bottom:25px;

}

.cta p{

font-size:20px;

margin-bottom:40px;

}

.button{

display:inline-block;

padding:16px 35px;

background:#f4b400;

color:white;

text-decoration:none;

font-weight:bold;

border-radius:10px;

transition:.3s;

}

.button:hover{

background:#d99800;

}

@media(max-width:768px){

.hero h1{

font-size:40px;

}

.hero p{

font-size:18px;

}

.intro h2{

font-size:30px;

}

.why-support h2{

font-size:32px;

}

.cta h2{

font-size:32px;

}

}

</style>